{
  "schema": "ld-s10y-image/figure-spec@2",
  "id": "fig-choice-floor-regions-FIRST",
  "mode": "deterministic",
  "description": "Authored plane-set candidates conditional on visible floor definition: A shades [0,1) times R, B shades R times [1,2), C shades [1,2) times [2,3), D shades the diagonal unit tiles [n,n+1) times [n,n+1), n integer. Solid edges are included; dashed edges excluded; filled/open corner dots resolve corner membership. Shading reaches the plot-window edge for unbounded sets; viewport borders are not set boundaries. All n tiles repeat beyond the view. No source image exists; inventory is conceptual, not pixel provenance.",
  "source": {
    "authoredBasis": "Authored plane-set candidates conditional on visible floor definition: A shades [0,1) times R, B shades R times [1,2), C shades [1,2) times [2,3), D shades the diagonal unit tiles [n,n+1) times [n,n+1), n integer. Solid edges are included; dashed edges excluded; filled/open corner dots resolve corner membership. Shading reaches the plot-window edge for unbounded sets; viewport borders are not set boundaries. All n tiles repeat beyond the view. No source image exists; inventory is conceptual, not pixel provenance.",
    "authoritativeText": [
      {
        "lesson": "alg8-c5-ex",
        "exercise": "720",
        "text": "720. 在坐标平面上指出点的集合，设：\na) $[x]=0$；\nb) $[y]=1$；\nc) $\\begin{cases}[x]=1,\\\\{}[y]=2.\\end{cases}$"
      },
      {
        "lesson": "alg8-c5-ex",
        "exercise": "721",
        "text": "721. 作出方程 $[x]=[y]$ 的图象."
      }
    ],
